\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell He seemed to think that if you did that, all would become clear. Clear as mud, I shouldn't wonder...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
