\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Well, I can't stop you leaving, I'm sure, but you won't be marching on an empty stomach! Come on\emdash dinner!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
