\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tries his hardest to sleep, but he's too confused by everything he's learned, and excited about his coming trip.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell Eventually...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Can't sleep either, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell You remember this tree, don't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I got my scarf stuck in it all those years ago... There I was, crying like mad, and there you were running round trying to help me get it down...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Heh... Some things never change, eh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell You know, I always imagined we'd spend our whole lives right here in Cobblestone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell That's why I was so surprised by what your mum said today. All that stuff about you being the Luminary, that reincarnation thing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I remember this story my grandad told me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell\lquote Once upon a time, long, long ago, the world was terrorised by a horrible monster. But then the Luminary appeared and saved the day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell\lquote When it was all over, the Luminary turned into a star, and he's been watching over us from up in the heavens ever since.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell That's his star, right there...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell How can you be the Luminary too? I... I just don't get it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell I know\emdash that's what you're going to Heliodor to find out. I understand, really I do...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Listen, we should both be getting back. Everyone will be wondering where we've got to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Goodbye...old friend...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell Exhausted after his long day, <pc> finally falls into a restless slumber.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell Then, morning comes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Well, just look at you! You don't scrub up too bad, you know. I only wish your grandfather were here to see you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell You won't forget him, will you? He was a fine, upstanding man\emdash the pride of the village. You could do worse than try to be like him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Well, however you turn out, I'm sure you'll find a way to overcome whatever lies ahead. A mother knows these things.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Oh, by the way, I've popped a little money I'd saved for a rainy day in your pack. Don't spend it all at once!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell Why don't you visit the village shop before you head off to Heliodor? You'll need some supplies for your big adventure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell But don't take too long\emdash the whole village is turning out to wave you off!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell One day you're just a little boy, the next you're getting ready to leave us. I only wish your grandfather could see what a fine young man you've become.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell To think it's been so many years already since old Chalky found you flo\emdash Ahem!\emdash I mean, since he brought you to Cobblestone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell We never thought there was anything out of the ordinary about you, and now suddenly there's all this talk of Luminaries, of all things!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell You know who the Luminary was, of course? The legendary hero who saved the world from a terrible darkness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell And we're supposed to believe that you're him reincarnated? Ha! I don't doubt old Chalky, of course, but it is a little hard to swallow, I must say.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell Oh, when you meet the King of Heliodor, put in a good word for old Cobblestone, won't you, eh? Heh heh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell If he finds out this is the village where the Luminary was raised, there might be something in it for us, if you catch my drift.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ooh, you are terrible! Trust you to be thinking about what you can get out of it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell Ho ho ho! I'm only joking, of course! The very thought! Ha ha ha! ...Ahem. Anyway, where was I...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell Ah, yes. Now, the fate that awaits you may well be one beyond anything we simple country folk can imagine.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell But you must allow us to offer what little assistance we can. Take this map of Erdrea with you. May it prove useful in finding your way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
