\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell And may this magnificent steed, the pride of Cobblestone, lighten your burden and speed you on your way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell You'll find Heliodor easily enough\emdash just head north out of the village and follow your nose.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell You travel safely now! Ooh, you're such a good boy! Such a good boy! You make us proud out there, won't you? And come back safe!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Goodbye! See you soon! All the best, now! Safe journey! Bye-bye!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
