\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Gemma\cell Here, take this with you! I... I made it for you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
