\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not at all, dear. I am just happy to see you both well again. But if you are leaving, you must be careful on the road.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems some dangerous criminals have escaped from the capital, and are at large somewhere in the area. Oh, I shudder to think what wicked deeds they might be capable of...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
