\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They will soon be caught, I am sure. Justice will be done. And until then, you are free to remain with us for as long as you please.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Thanks, we appreciate that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
