\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell That's the spirit! But we can't have you bringing us any unwanted attention... Ah, I've got just the thing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Here, put this on and keep your face hidden, otherwise you're going to get nabbed as soon as you set foot in Heliodor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Heh! That's more like it! If you're going to be a wanted man, you might as well look the part! Right, let's head north and hit town!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
