\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell All this time I hated that mermaid for what she did to my grandfather, but now I see how he really felt. He wasn't cursed\f1\emdash\f0 he really loved her. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Crivens, this place is a veritable paradise under the sea! Just when ye think you've seen it all, ye find yourself in mermaid town! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So we can breathe underwater now? That harp is something else.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Well, now we're here, I guess we can find out if that story about the giant pearl is just an old wives' tale or not. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Finding the Orb is important, but we need to talk to the Queen first. We have to tell her about Michelle... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I welcome you to Nautica, the land beneath the waves. What brings you, Prince of Dundrasil, down to these coral caves? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Huh? How do you know he's the Prince of Dundrasil? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Hm hm. I have a second sight that touches every quarter, by which I keep abreast of all the news above the water. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Of doomed love between men and mermaids, let us later speak\f1\emdash\f0 first, allow me to present the item that you seek.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Behold, the shining sphere of green, the Orb you humans need. The treasures of the world above are marvellous indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Consider this my thanks for what you did for dear Michelle. Pray take it, kindly travellers, and may it serve you well. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives the Green Orb! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I witnessed the whole sorry tale, it always breaks my heart\f1\emdash\f0 the tragedy of man and mermaid doomed to live apart.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell But while the Mermaid's Burden holds, such romances are blighted, and love between man and sea maiden fizzles, unrequited.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell For years now I have sought a way to remedy this curse. Alas, my every effort ends in failure or worse...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell You humans cannot help but seem a fragile kind to we, who live five hundred years and more down here beneath the sea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell But though the flame of human life burns short, it burns so bright! You never cease to struggle, no\f1\emdash\f0 you push, you strive, you fight!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell And so, your kind admire our kind, but we admire in turn. It is the World Tree's will that from each other we should learn.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell It was the World Tree's will that brought Michelle and Kai together\f1\emdash\f0 I pray that in their next lives, they may stay that way forever. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell So too was it the World Tree's will that brought you here today, but now, dear Luminary, you must be upon your way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell So set sail on the tide of time, that flows ceaselessly on, and if Yggdrasil wills it, we shall meet again anon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Remember, though the paths we walk are filled with twists and turns, all roads lead from the Tree of Life, and to the Tree return. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Here we are! The Crystal Kingdom of Sniflheim\f1\emdash\f0 home to the famous Blue Orb! It's a fair wee while since I've visited, but it warms my heart to be back! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hmph! That must be about the only thing that IS warm around here! Let's hurry up and get inside before we all freeze to death! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Huh? What's this...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What the\f1\emdash\f0 !? The gates are covered in ice! Look\f1\emdash\f0 they're frozen shut! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell How strange... Still, I suppose it's only natural they'd ice up in a climate as cold as this. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Natural, my foot! What about all the people inside? How are they supposed to live if they can't get in or out of the city? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, ye've a point there, lassie. They've always made sure to keep the main gate free of frost, even in the dead of winter... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell So what are we supposed to do? There's an Orb in there we need to get to. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, if we cannae go in through the front door, we'll just have to head round the back! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What's going on...? The whole city's been turned to ice... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell It's just like what happened to the gates. This doesn't seem natural at all. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell This may be the Crystal Kingdom, but it shouldnae be frozen solid, cold winter or no. We'd better take a look around... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (gasp) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, I'm sorry! You gave me a fright. I hadn't expected to see travellers in town. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Finally! Someone who hasn't been turned into a block of ice! Can you tell us what happened here? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well...it all began three months ago. It was a bright, sunny day, just like any other, when suddenly a strange shadow filled the sky...it was a witch! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
