\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just so. She chanted an ancient incantation, and just like that, the town was engulfed in a ferocious snowstorm!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The wind took my breath clean away, and before I knew it, I had fainted. And when I awoke...all was frozen. I was the only one spared... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell She must be a pretty powerful witch to freeze this whole city with a single spell. I wish I could help, but all this ice is more than my magic can melt... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell By the way, missy\f1\emdash\f0 that symbol on yer shawl... Is that not...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
