\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, forgive me! I haven't introduced myself yet, have I? I am Frysabel, Queen of Sniflheim. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
