\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell It looks like Sniflheim's in a bit of a sticky situation. I suppose now isn't a good time to ask about the Orb... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
