\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Why, the big blue ball that's been handed down in yer family for generations, lassie! Truth be told...we need to borrow it. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell O-Oh, of course! You would be welcome to borrow it...but I am afraid it is locked up tight inside the castle...which is locked up tight inside the ice... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
