\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hmm... Maybe if we got rid of that wicked witch, it might break her spell... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1742\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell I thought just the same thing. Why, only a few days ago, a band of soldiers from a faraway land came here to investigate what was happening.\par
\par
I sent them out to try and find the witch and fight her...but I haven't seen them since... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
