\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What kind of hero are you, playing with the poor girl's feelings like that!? I'll ask you again, and this time, you'll answer properly!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
