\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Turns out that when the wind picks up around here, the air fills with snow and you can't see a thing in front of you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
