\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Please, stop! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell It's the book! The voice is coming from the book! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, you have to listen to me! I am the real Frysabel! The woman in front of you is the witch! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell What!? Ridiculous! She's the witch, not me! Don't believe her lies! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hmph! Trick us once, shame on you\f1\emdash\f0 trick us twice, shame on us! You might not like being trapped in there again, but you'll just have to get used to it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No, you're wrong! The spell didn't work because Snorri paused in the middle of it! You have to believe me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell She's lying! The wicked witch is trying to trick you again! You have to believe me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Everybody, calm down! I have been Her Majesty's tutor for ten years. If anyone can tell the real Queen from the impostor, it is me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell I will ask one question to both of you. Whoever answers it correctly is the real Queen Frysabel! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Here is the question: what is the true treasure of Sniflheim? The real Frysabel would remember her father's teachings well! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Tee hee! That's easy! The true treasure of Sniflheim is clearly the Blue Orb! What else could it be but something so valuable? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Hmm... The Orb, you say? Very well, very well...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Now then, what is your answer? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The true treasure of Sniflheim is its people. Though the bleakest blizzards assail them, ever do they warm these frigid climes with their ardent hearts. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Precisely! The very words the royal family have passed down through the generations! The real Queen Frysabel is the one in the book! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell No... She's a liar, you fools! You imbeciles, can't you see! Curse you! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Oh yes, very queenly! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Fine! You caught me out again! I surrender, I surrender. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1742\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Ugh! I wait all that time to get my powers back, and you make me waste every last drop on escaping that wretched book again!\par
\par
My magic is spent. My life is yours. Boil me in a cauldron, burn me at the stake...just get it over with. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Men! Take her to the dungeon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Wait! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Your Majesty! What are you doing!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Queen Frysabel! Please, step away from her! She says she has lost her powers, but how can we know for sure? She is a witch! It is in her nature to lie! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Everyone, listen to me! It is true that Krystalinda did something unforgivable when she froze this city...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell But...we spoke from time to time when she held me captive. She listened to me...she even helped me to understand what it is to be queen...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Hers is not a bad heart. And the time I spent in the book...it gave me the chance to think...to ready myself to truly rule at last.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Please, I believe her when she says her powers are spent. She is not a threat to us any longer. We must let her live. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell She seems convinced, Snorri. Why not give Krystalinda one last chance? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Very well. You are the ruler of this kingdom, Your Majesty. If that is your decision, we will gladly follow it. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Hmph! Must you be so nicey-nicey, Frysabel? You're making me look bad... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Krystalinda, there's something I still don't understand\f1\emdash\f0 why did ye freeze Sniflheim in the first place? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Oh, that was a favour for a friend. The splendid specimen who released me from the grimoire... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell As you know, I was trapped in that dusty, fusty library for a horribly long time. Ugh, it was so, so boring!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Then, three months ago, he appeared. He took down my book from the shelf and spoke to me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will release you from your prison. But you must do something for me in return. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell For a beautiful boy like you? Anything! Free me, and I am yours forever more. What is your desire, my pretty? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You must freeze Sniflheim. When you do, a great hero will be sent to save the city. One who wears the same pendant as I. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: His name is Hendrik. And when he arrives...I would like you to kill him. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1742\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell So I did as he asked. And when the great hero arrived...I decided to have him run a little errand for me before I disposed of him.\par
\par
To slay a mighty beast that just happened to have stolen my powers. And, well...the rest you know. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The same pendant as Sir Hendrik, eh? And what was this handsome young fellow's name, might I ask? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell His name? Oh, I haven't a clue. He disappeared after he freed me, and I haven't seen him since. It's a shame\f1\emdash\f0 he was such a pretty little thing... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hmm... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Thank you once again for all you have done for me and my kingdom. The Orb is yours to do with as you see fit. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives the Blue Orb! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell But Your Majesty, isn't the Orb one of your kingdom's most precious treasures? Are you sure you don't mind us taking it? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Of course! As my father always said, the true treasure of this kingdom is its people\f1\emdash\f0 and if not for you, they may well have been frozen forever. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Well, if you insist! Best of luck with all your royal duties, and try not to let the pressure get to you, okay? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Oh, don't worry about that, little girl\f1\emdash\f0 Frysabel will be just fine. I plan to take very good care of her! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc>'s Orb collection is complete! Head east through the Sn\'e6rfelt and climb through the First Forest to open a path to Yggdrasil!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What are you doing loitering by the docks, Erik? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell None of your business. So? Did you get the Orb or what? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell We did! And all because I can spot a phony a mile off! You can thank me later! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell What's wrong, Rab? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, it's nothing, lassie. I just cannae stop wondering who the handsome young fellow that put Krystalinda up to all this might be... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell He'd have to be very important indeed to have the same pendant as the mighty Sir Hendrik. You don't think it could have been Mordegon himself, do you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I wish I knew Serena, really I do... Well, standing around here guessing won't do us any good\f1\emdash\f0 we've a Tree of Life to be getting to. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Come on, you horrible lot. This adventure isnae over yet\f1\emdash\f0 onward to Yggdrasil! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell C-Crivens! Heh heh. How, how, how did that get there? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Is this what you were so engrossed in back at the Library, Rab? I thought you said it was a spellbook! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Another one to add to the collection, eh? And there I was thinking you'd finally got over your little obsession... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Sir Rab\f1\emdash\f0 you have been caught red-handed! And red-faced! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell And after you'd just done your rousing speech too. Talk about mortifying... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell B-B-B-But\f1\emdash\f0 ! Wait! Ye don't understand! I only read them for the articles! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ...The articles, I tell ye!!! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Who would have thought a place like this would be hidden away at the top of that mountain trail? It's...breathtaking... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Oh, stop it you\f1\emdash\f0 you're making me blush! Although, I suppose the old hometown is pretty amazing... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Wait\f1\emdash\f0 you mean this is... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell It is indeed! Welcome to Arboria, home of the Keepers\f1\emdash\f0 the ones who watch over the world from beneath Yggdrasil's branches. And of Veronica and I! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I always thought it was a little bit, well...dull...but it's good to be back! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell The altar in the vision we saw appeared to be in the highest part of the First Forest, which lies just beyond the village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell But we should stop off in Arboria before we head up there. Everyone will be ever so pleased when they find out the Luminary has come to visit! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: O great and glorious Yggdrasil, whose holy heart is the source of all life, and to whom all life returns\f1\emdash\f0 we thank You for this gift.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The withered leaves fall from Your branches, and fresh buds spring forth in their place. One life ends, and another begins.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: O mighty mother Yggdrasil, we pray that You will bless this new bud, this child of Arboria. May he grow into a leaf worthy of Your benevolent boughs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Ah!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, well. Our beloved twins return! And how long have you two been loitering there, pray? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Good day, Holy Father. It's ever so nice to see you again. And everybody else, of course. Everyone seems well. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As do you, my dear. But Veronica...were you not...taller when last we met? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Well, err... It's a long story...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Anyway, that's not important right now. What is important is that we did what you told us to\f1\emdash\f0 we found the Luminary! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Luminary! Can it really be? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, what a blessed day this is! Not only do we welcome a new life into the village, but the Luminary also!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am Benedictus, High Priest of Arboria...and I have waited my whole life for this moment. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Holy Father... On our travels, we learned of a grave threat to this world. A being of pure evil, who plots to throw all Erdrea into turmoil... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
\pard\intbl Benedictus\cell ...I see. So this Mordegon has corrupted the minds of Heliodor's best and boldest, and is using his evil influence to turn the world against our friend here? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1333\cellx10357 
